  message: "Staleness audit 2026-07-21: the premised harm (a string-equality join between the sketch's repo_fingerprint field and the run record's failing on every pair) was NEVER realizable — grep of sketch.py/schema.py finds NO emitted sketch_precomputed.repo_fingerprint field (the item's own verifiability note already conceded it reads None). The surviving compute_repo_fingerprint(...)[:16] truncation moved to _get_repo_state_hash (sketch_embeddings.py:1372-1390), an explicit internal CACHE-DIR state hash ('keeps cache-dir names short'); _get_repo_fingerprint (1325) no longer calls compute_repo_fingerprint at all. Retitled to reflect the by-design cache hash. Close-eligible (no realizable defect) on owner's call; left open pending that decision."  # f8e2
